{
  "slug": "press-release-writing",
  "concept": "Press Release Writing",
  "generated": "2026-09-08",
  "summary": "A press release is a short, journalist-facing news document with a single goal: make it so easy to publish your news that a busy reporter (or a wire-service automated feed) can run it nearly verbatim.",
  "facets": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "A press release is a short, journalist-facing news document with a single goal: make it so easy to publish your news that a busy reporter (or a wire-service automated feed) can run it nearly verbatim.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The defining traits of a press release:",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Third person, past or present tense, never \"we\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Inverted-pyramid structure",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "AP Style dateline at the top of the body",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Stable boilerplate at the bottom (the \"About\" paragraph)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Quote attribution that is publication-ready",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "End mark: ### centered on its own line",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "400–600 words is the sweet spot",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#overview",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "1. The headline (and the subhead)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Under ~100 characters.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#1-the-headline-and-the-subhead",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "No marketing puffery: avoid \"industry-leading,\" \"revolutionary,\" \"best-in-class.\"",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#1-the-headline-and-the-subhead",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "State the news, not the spin.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#1-the-headline-and-the-subhead",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "2. Release-type tag",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "FOR IMMEDIATE RELEASE - the default",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#2-release-type-tag",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "EMBARGOED UNTIL: [Day, Month Day, Year, HH:MM TIME ZONE]",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#2-release-type-tag",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "MEDIA ADVISORY - for an upcoming event/availability",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#2-release-type-tag",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Always include the time zone for embargoes.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#2-release-type-tag",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "3. The dateline (AP Style)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "City name in ALL CAPS",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#3-the-dateline-ap-style",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "AP state abbreviation (not USPS!)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#3-the-dateline-ap-style",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Date written out: Nov. 12, 2026 (AP uses abbreviated months for Jan., Feb., Aug., Sept., Oct., Nov., Dec.)",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#3-the-dateline-ap-style",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Em dash (—) before the lede",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#3-the-dateline-ap-style",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "4. The lede (and the five Ws)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The first sentence must contain Who, What, When, Where, Why.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#4-the-lede-and-the-five-ws",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Bad lede: > Acme Corp, a leading provider of analytics solutions, is excited to announce today an important new milestone in its ongoing growth journey.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#4-the-lede-and-the-five-ws",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Good lede: > Acme Corp today announced it has acquired Beta Analytics, a Boston-based real-time data platform, for $400 million in cash and stock.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#4-the-lede-and-the-five-ws",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "5. The body (inverted pyramid)",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Paragraph 2: amplification - the size, the scope, the differentiator.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#5-the-body-inverted-pyramid",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Paragraph 3: the executive quote.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#5-the-body-inverted-pyramid",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Paragraph 4–5: supporting detail.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#5-the-body-inverted-pyramid",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Paragraph 6: optional second quote.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#5-the-body-inverted-pyramid",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Paragraph 7: practical info - availability, pricing, link.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#5-the-body-inverted-pyramid",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Boilerplate: stable \"About\" paragraph(s).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#5-the-body-inverted-pyramid",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Media contact block.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#5-the-body-inverted-pyramid",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "6. Quote attribution",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Standard pattern: > \"We chose Beta because their real-time architecture is the strongest in the market,\" said Jane Doe, CEO of Acme Corp.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#6-quote-attribution",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Attribution after the first sentence of the quote.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#6-quote-attribution",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "said is the AP-standard verb. Avoid stated, commented, noted, exclaimed.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#6-quote-attribution",
          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Full name + title + company on first reference.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#6-quote-attribution",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "7. The boilerplate",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "60–120 words. Updated when a hard fact changes.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#7-the-boilerplate",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "9. The end mark",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "The release ends with ### centered on its own line (or the older -30-).",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/press-release-writing/#9-the-end-mark",
          "note": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "References",
